{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7671291465092598057","title":"规控算法工程师-扫地机","description":"1、负责扫地机器人路径规划模块开发（全局覆盖规划、局部避障、充电桩对接等）；\n2、精通常规路径规划算法（A*、RRT、PRM、MPC等），包括不限于基于优化、采样等规划算法；\n3、实现并优化运动控制算法（差速运动学、差速驱动控制等）；\n4、针对复杂场景（沿边清扫、地毯、家具低矮、脱困等）进行策略优化；\n5、参与端到端规划、强化学习探索和研究；\n6、参与算法仿真测试和实机验证，并进行相关算法移植与性能优化。","requirement":"1、2027届硕士/本科毕业生，计算机/电子/自动化/机器人等相关专业；\n2、掌握C++编程，熟悉基本数据结构与算法；\n3、了解路径规划算法（A*、BFS等）和以及实时规划算法、常规控制算法；\n4、熟悉Linux开发环境，了解ROS；\n5、较强的逻辑思维和学习能力，对机器人领域有热情；\n6、熟悉深度强化学习（PPO、SAC、DQN等），有实际项目经验，优先；\n7、有机器人竞赛（RoboMaster、智能车等）或相关项目经验，优先；\n8、有ICRA/IROS/CoRL/NeurIPS等顶会论文发表经历，优先。","city_info":{"code":"CT_154","name":"武汉","en_name":"Wuhan","i18n_name":"武汉"},"recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1786112067264,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7659311908839262514","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届校园招聘计划","i18n":"2027届校园招聘计划"},"limit_count":2,"active_status":1},"job_function":{"id":"7178759516879405165","name":"软件研发类","en_name":"Software R\u0026D","i18n_name":"软件研发类"},"job_id":"7671291465092466985","city_list":[{"code":"CT_154","name":"武汉","en_name":"Wuhan","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"武汉","py_name":"wuhan","mdm_code":"MDCY00000216","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":[]},"city_info_list_for_delivery":[{"code":"CT_154","